BVRRSeparatorReviewPhotosTop\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRPhotoSectionHeader\"><div class=\"BVRRPhotoSectionLabel BVRRReviewPhotoSectionLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRPhotoSectionHint BVRRReviewPhotoSectionHint\">Click an image to enlarge it.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVRRPhotoSectionContent\"><div class=\"BVRRPhotoLine BVRRReviewPhotoLine\"><div class=\"BVRRPhotoSectionSeparator BVRRPhotoSectionSeparatorTop\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRPhoto\"><div id=\"BVRRPhotoPopup19594593\" class=\"BVRRPhotoPopup\" onclick=\"$bv('#BVRRActivePhotoID, #BVRRPhotoFrameID').hide();\" style=\"display: none\"><div class=\"BVRRPhotoPopupHint\">(Click anywhere inside this popup to close it)<\/div><div class=\"BVRRPhotoPopupImage\"><img id=\"BVRRPhotoImage19594593\" alt=\"User submitted photo\"/><\/div><div class=\"BVRRPhotoPopupCaption\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVRRPhotoSectionThumbnail BVRRReviewPhotoThumbnail\" onclick=\"bvrrPhoto.createPhotoPopup(&quot;19594593&quot;, &quot;https://photos-eu.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86d2FsbWFydA/29c9a4fe-eed1-5b35-beeb-1d8b64385975&quot;, &quot;BVRRDisplayContentReviewID_401721818&quot;, &quot;BVRRPhotoThumbnailImage_tzw6fiagux38lskk94fkfekfu_ID&quot;, null, []);\" data-bvtrack=\"eName:Media,mediaType:Photo\"><img id=\"BVRRPhotoThumbnailImage_tzw6fiagux38lskk94fkfekfu_ID\" src=\"https://photos-eu.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86d2FsbWFydA/bd3d7a19-d42d-58ae-85f8-8c36d200defa\" alt=\"User submitted photo\"/><\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVRRPhotoSectionSeparator BVRRPhotoSectionSeparatorBottom\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVRRSeparator BVRRSeparatorReviewPhotosBottom\"><\/div><\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Main\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerTop\"><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewRatingsContainer\"> <div class=\"BVRROverallRatingContainer\" >\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"5 out of 5\" title=\"5 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">5<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewTitleContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">This was a great buy!!!<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">10/19/2025<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2025-10-19\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText401721818_ah7mf5gnx5lahc7hulxaunxi7_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">So glad I purchased this auger. I looked into renting one but decided to buy my own as it was more economical than renting for a week from the home improvement store. I planted 16 holly shrubs using this auger in under 4 hrs. One person can manage<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkPrefix\">...<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText401721818_ah7mf5gnx5lahc7hulxaunxi7_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview401721818_5v32cx1poazpig4fbmfjtpy5u_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(read full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div id=\"BVRRReview401721818_5v32cx1poazpig4fbmfjtpy5u_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText BVDIHidden\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">So glad I purchased this auger. I looked into renting one but decided to buy my own as it was more economical than renting for a week from the home improvement store. I planted 16 holly shrubs using this auger in under 4 hrs. One person can manage this tool, highly recommended.<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText401721818_ah7mf5gnx5lahc7hulxaunxi7_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview401721818_5v32cx1poazpig4fbmfjtpy5u_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(hide full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"BVDI_FV\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVVoting BVDI_FVVotingHelpfulness\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVSum BVDI_FVSumHelpf